Telecom operators and neutral hosts also represent important customer groups. Their investment in small-cell infrastructure creates demand for semiconductor components supporting the development of compact base station equipment.

The combination of public network expansion and private wireless deployment broadens the market opportunity for specialized 5G ASIC suppliers.

